{"text": "HALLORAN VUKOVIC & TSANG LLP\nAttorneys at Law · 980 Ninth Street, Suite 1450, Sacramento, CA 95814\n\nTel 916-555-0117 · Fed. Tax ID 68-0417729\n\nINVOICE / TRUST STATEMENT\nInvoice no. HVT-26-03318. Invoice date: April 3, 2026. Billing period: 03/01/26 to\n03/31/26.\n\nBill to: Marisela Quiroga-Bentz, 4417 Larkmoor Way, Elk Grove, CA 95758-2204\n\nClient no. 20417. Matter no. 20417.003. Re: Quiroga-Bentz v. Tannehill Roofing\nSupply, Inc., Sacramento County Superior Court No. 34-2025-00381176\n\nProfessional services\n03/02/26 OA 1.4 hrs. Review Tannehill production (TRS000412 to TRS000987); call\nw/ client re missing change orders. $574.00\n\n03/05/26 KM 2.1 hrs. Draft subpoena to Yolo Delta Community Bank for records of\nacct ending -7731; calendar depo of Wade Tannehill. $399.00\n\n03/11/26 OA 3.6 hrs. Prepare for and take deposition of W. Tannehill (half day),\nincl. travel to Rancho Cordova. $1,476.00\n\n03/12/26 KM 0.5 hrs. Email to Ms. Quiroga-Bentz w/ depo summary; she reports\nDietrich is recovering from rotator cuff surgery and cannot attend the 4/14 MSC.\n$95.00\n\n03/19/26 OA 0.8 hrs. Tel. conf. w/ opposing counsel Renata Szymborska\n(Szymborska & Pell) re CCP § 998 offer of $41,500. $328.00\n\n03/27/26 OA 1.2 hrs. Draft mediation brief; review roof inspection report by G.\nFarkas. $492.00\n\nRates: Oluwaseun Adeleke (partner) $410/hr; Kirsten Maddox (paralegal) $190/hr.\nTotal fees: $3,364.00\n\nCosts advanced\n03/11/26 Tule Fog Reporting Services, Tannehill transcript, inv. TF-88213: $712.35\n\n03/06/26 Service of bank subpoena, Capitol Corridor Attorney Service: $85.00\n\n03/20/26 Filing fee, stipulation and order: $60.00\n\n03/24/26 Site inspection fee, Gil Farkas (roofing consultant), paid by firm check\n#10418: $600.00\n\nTotal costs: $1,457.35\n\nClient trust account activity\nTrust funds are held per Rule 1.15 in our pooled IOLTA account at Yolo Delta\nCommunity Bank, ABA 121863605, acct 004-417-20933; client ledger 20417-T.\n\n02/28/26 Balance forward: $2,150.00\n\n03/09/26 Replenishment, Visa ending 3448 (D. Bentz), auth code 09417B: $2,500.00\n\n03/31/26 Applied to invoice HVT-26-02901 (February): ($1,988.40)\n\n03/31/26 Ending trust balance: $2,661.60\n\nAmount due\nFees and costs this invoice: $4,821.35. Less trust applied: $2,661.60. BALANCE DUE\n$2,159.75 by April 24, 2026.\n\nEvergreen retainer: per § 4 of the fee agreement the trust balance must then be\nrestored to $2,500. Unless we hear otherwise by 4/10/26 we will charge the card on\nfile.\n\nCardholder: DIETRICH A BENTZ. Visa 4168 9645 2135 3448, exp 08/28, billing ZIP\n95758. Authorized amount: $4,659.75 (balance plus retainer).\n\nPrefer to wire? Yolo Delta Community Bank, routing 121863605, operating acct\n0044170388, NOT the trust account. Or pay online at\nhttps://pay.hvtlaw.example/inv/HVT-26-03318.\n\nQuestions: kmaddox@hvtlaw.example or (916) 555-0117 ext. 204.\n\nNote from Seun: Marisela, the $41.5k offer expires April 18. Please call my cell,\n916.555.0162, before then. Also, Dieter asked that statements stop going to his\nwork address at Folsom Lake Glass & Mirror; done.", "kind": "PDF", "detail": "2 pages · 444 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Marisela Quiroga-Bentz", "W. Tannehill", "Renata Szymborska", "Kirsten Maddox", "Oluwaseun Adeleke", "Dietrich", "DIETRICH A BENTZ", "Marisela", "Seun", "Dieter"], "companies": ["HALLORAN VUKOVIC & TSANG LLP", "Tule Fog Reporting Services", "Yolo Delta Community Bank", "Capitol Corridor Attorney Service", "Szymborska & Pell", "Folsom Lake Glass & Mirror", "hvtlaw.example"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Sacramento", "Central Valley", "Elk Grove", "Yolo Delta Community Bank", "Rancho Cordova", "Tule Fog Reporting Services", "Capitol Corridor Attorney Service", "Gil Farkas", "Yolo", "Folsom Lake Glass & Mirror"], "health": [], "sensitive": [], "names": ["Marisela", "W. Tannehill", "Dietrich", "Renata", "DIETRICH", "Seun", "Dieter"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "fa